{"title":"The Hollow Herald","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Hollow Herald is a named <a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a> seen at level 44.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Hollow Herald</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-hollow-herald\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><p class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for The Hollow Herald yet.</p>\n      <h2>Other named Mummys</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/the-sun-king\">The Sun King</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/b58b812bf2c6457014f8.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Hollow Herald</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>44</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>699</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}